00:19:03,350 --> 00:19:07,990
当我们拥有过多上下文时基本上就希望使用它们
where we basically want to use them when we have too much of this context,

321
00:19:08,130 --> 00:19:09,730
比如说有二十多个工具时
mostly, like over 20 tools,

