or just security compliance,

328
00:19:27,630 --> 00:19:32,550
比如你需要在某家医院内部本地部署一个智能体
if you need to have one agent locally inside one hospital,

329
00:19:32,670 --> 00:19:36,750
比如说我之前就在医疗行业工作
for example, because I was in the healthcare field before,

