It has tools, internet or web access.

348
00:20:43,850 --> 00:20:45,870
它是可靠的会引用自己的信息来源
It's reliable, it will cite its sources.

349
00:20:46,810 --> 00:20:49,450
它内部有自我反馈循环
It has feedback loops with itself,

350
00:20:49,550 --> 00:20:51,690
也会与人类进行交互以获取人类反馈
but also with the human for human feedback.

351
00:20:52,850 --> 00:20:55,570
所以正如我们所见这要智能体化得多
So this is much more agentic, as we see.

352
00:20:56,530 --> 00:21:03,190
它运行的环境通常是网页用户提供的资料或者简单的API访问
It evolves in an environment which is typically the web or user-provided sources or just API access.

353
00:21:03,750 --> 00:21:06,650
它是目标驱动的只有一个核心目标
And it's goal-driven. It has one objective.

354
00:21:06,810 --> 00:21:08,490
我们不会精确告诉它要如何完成
We don't tell it how to do it exactly.

355
00:21:08,570 --> 00:21:10,890
我们只会告诉它去研究某个主题
We just tell it do a research about something.

356
00:21:11,870 --> 00:21:14,410
因此它通常远不止是一个聊天机器人
So it's typically much more than just a chatbot.

357
00:21:14,630 --> 00:21:20,610
它本质上是在替代一个会对特定主题进行非常深入研究的人
It basically replaces someone that would do a very thorough research about a specific topic.

358
00:21:20,750 --> 00:21:21,730
它会规划会搜索
It plans, it searches,

359
00:21:21,830 --> 00:21:26,730
会检查会转向会综合信息并且可以反复迭代
it inspects, pivots, it synthesizes information and can iterate.

360
00:21:27,830 --> 00:21:29,710
所以深度研究系统确实是
So deep research systems are really,

