00:22:39,910 --> 00:22:41,650
我也认为你们都应该这样做
and I think you all should do as well,

381
00:22:41,710 --> 00:22:46,690
我们一开始会先问自己一系列问题以更好地理解应该如何去做
we started this with asking ourselves questions to better understand how we should do it

382
00:22:46,690 --> 00:22:47,850
以及我们是否真的应该去做
and if we should do it at all.

383
00:22:48,310 --> 00:22:50,470
第一个问题是这件事值得做吗
The first question is, is this worthwhile?

384
00:22:51,530 --> 00:22:56,150
是否已经存在我们之外可以直接使用的解决方案
Is there a solution outside of what we could build that already exists?

385
00:22:57,170 --> 00:23:01,930
我们的分析是高质量技术内容的生产成本非常高
So our analysis is that high quality technical content is expensive to produce.

