所以没错理想状态是把这套流程的大部分自动化
So yeah, it would be ideal to automate most of this process.

394
00:23:31,170 --> 00:23:34,890
正如我所说研究部分需要很强的召回率和精确率
As I said, the research needs strong recall and precision.

395
00:23:36,090 --> 00:23:36,830
而在另一端
And on the other side,

396
00:23:36,910 --> 00:23:38,710
写作部分则需要更受约束
the writing needs to be more constrained.

397
00:23:38,790 --> 00:23:40,730
它需要避免幻觉
It needs to avoid hallucinations,

398
00:23:40,930 --> 00:23:44,170
保持高质量并遵循你的语气或你想要的写作风格
be of high quality, follow your tone or the writing tone that you want,

399
00:23:44,570 --> 00:23:45,650
以及你想要的结构
the structure that you want.

