00:23:46,690 --> 00:23:48,910
就深度研究工具而言
And in terms of deep research tools,

401
00:23:49,650 --> 00:23:57,290
我们几乎每天都会用到所有这些工具，而且它们实在过于详尽
we use all of them pretty much daily and they are way too exhaustive.

