00:24:46,130 --> 00:24:50,050
而且要和语境相契合
And the ones that are appropriate to the context.

418
00:24:50,510 --> 00:24:56,230
所以要把这一切完全自动化是非常难的，我们也希望在这里始终保留人类参与
So it was... it's really difficult to automate all this and we want to keep a human in the loop there.

419
00:24:59,330 --> 00:25:02,630
接下来我们问自己的第一个实际问题是
Now, the first actual question we ask ourselves is,

