00:25:02,910 --> 00:25:03,750
架构应该是什么样的
what should be the architecture?

421
00:25:04,250 --> 00:25:05,870
它应该是一个智能体
If it should be an agent,

422
00:25:06,010 --> 00:25:07,670
多个智能体，还是一个工作流
multiple agents, a workflow?

423
00:25:08,370 --> 00:25:09,790
我们的分析是
And the analysis here is that,

424
00:25:10,030 --> 00:25:13,090
首先，研究这一部分本身非常探索性
first, we have the research part that is really exploratory.

425
00:25:13,590 --> 00:25:17,130
它需要找到大量信息来源
It needs to find lots of sources.

426
00:25:17,390 --> 00:25:22,230
它需要在网上不断探索，在缺少信息时弄清楚自己还需要找到什么
It needs to explore the web to understand what it needs to find if it misses information.

427
00:25:22,430 --> 00:25:24,650
所以它需要具备迭代能力
So it needs to be able to iterate,

428
00:25:24,870 --> 00:25:26,210
能够转向、重新搜索
to pivot, to search again.

429
00:25:26,910 --> 00:25:28,170
它需要很大的灵活性
It needs a lot of flexibility.

430
00:25:28,890 --> 00:25:29,730
而在另一边
And on the other side,

431
00:25:29,950 --> 00:25:32,210
写作智能体则要确定性强得多
the writing agent is much more deterministic.

432
00:25:32,510 --> 00:25:35,430
它需要遵循特定的语气
It needs to follow a specific tone,

433
00:25:35,530 --> 00:25:36,350
遵循特定结构
to follow a structure,

434
00:25:41,190 --> 00:25:45,310
总之，它需要的约束远多于灵活性
to... yeah, it needs to be much more constrained than it needs flexibility.

435
00:25:45,850 --> 00:25:47,390
你不希望出现这种AI烂文
You don't want this AI slope.

436
00:25:47,470 --> 00:25:49,370
你不希望出现那些特定的烂词、套话句子
You don't want specific words, specific sentences.

437
00:25:49,550 --> 00:25:52,710
你希望的是特定的句式和特定的格式
You want specific sentences and specific formats.

438
00:25:52,950 --> 00:25:54,150
所以它的约束要严格得多
So it's much more constrained.

439
00:25:54,530 --> 00:25:57,390
因此我们这里存在一个冲突：研究需要灵活性
So we have a conflict here where the research needs flexibility,

440
00:25:57,730 --> 00:25:59,950
但写作需要约束
but the writing needs constraint.

