一个是更偏探索、更动态、更智能体化的研究智能体
the research agent that is more exploratory, dynamic, more agentic,

443
00:26:08,330 --> 00:26:10,390
另一个是写作智能体
and the writer agent,

444
00:26:10,530 --> 00:26:13,230
也就是更具确定性和一致性的写作系统
the writer system that is more deterministic and consistent.

